    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a <strong>documentary game</strong> that delves into the history of beliefs in devils and <strong>witches</strong>, layering it with contemporary insights. Immerse yourself in the darkness of the Middle Ages at your own pace, and let <i>Lucifer </i>be your guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/43bbca2c3e30f7c96de75709709aa9b9.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The experience is centered on <strong>story and atmosphere</strong>. You will not find difficult choices, action sequences, or inventory management here; movement is limited to progressing through locations along with the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/c9dd46a99f5245cad939ee0be2aaede9.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the intricate beliefs surrounding <strong>black magic</strong> from diverse perspectives across time and place. Unravel centuries-old occult knowledge, tracing the evolution of <i>fear </i>and fascination across cultures. Immerse yourself in a rich tapestry of historical and geographical contexts, each offering unique insights into the enigmatic world of dark arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/58ed29ac6c79a9654f9b30aad9c64c0e.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a suspenseful story that sheds light on the severe aftermath of blasphemy and the deep fear of <strong>divine consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/d53d2492d8279934db4656d48bbda138.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are interested in the concept, you can check out our <strong>FREE</strong> adaptation of H. P. Lovecraft's short story <i>Dagon</i>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a <strong>documentary game</strong> that delves into the history of beliefs in devils and <strong>witches</strong>, layering it with contemporary insights. Immerse yourself in the darkness of the Middle Ages at your own pace, and let <i>Lucifer </i>be your guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/43bbca2c3e30f7c96de75709709aa9b9.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The experience is centered on <strong>story and atmosphere</strong>. You will not find difficult choices, action sequences, or inventory management here; movement is limited to progressing through locations along with the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/c9dd46a99f5245cad939ee0be2aaede9.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the intricate beliefs surrounding <strong>black magic</strong> from diverse perspectives across time and place. Unravel centuries-old occult knowledge, tracing the evolution of <i>fear </i>and fascination across cultures. Immerse yourself in a rich tapestry of historical and geographical contexts, each offering unique insights into the enigmatic world of dark arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/58ed29ac6c79a9654f9b30aad9c64c0e.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a suspenseful story that sheds light on the severe aftermath of blasphemy and the deep fear of <strong>divine consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/d53d2492d8279934db4656d48bbda138.avif?t=1748878801\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are interested in the concept, you can check out our <strong>FREE</strong> adaptation of H. P. Lovecraft's short story <i>Dagon</i>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
